# ── Audion Windows Tools by Max.mov ──
# Source, docs, small functional assets (.pow, scripts), and PDFs are tracked.
# Only heavy/regenerated/runtime artifacts are excluded — ship those in the Release bundle.

# Portable PowerShell 7 — regenerated locally by Install\Install-Portable-PowerShell.cmd
Engine/PowerShell/

# Heavy media resources (wallpapers, cursors, profiles, gaming pack) — Release bundle only
Assets/MaxMov/

# Local runtime state — tweak backups and theme/lang preferences
Data/
